import tmp.sheaf.xif.paper.S1345Ind3LogShellProcessionActual
import tmp.sheaf.xif.paper.S1315SourceIndActionsAssemblyActual
import Mathlib.Data.ZMod.Basic
import Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Basic

/-!
# S1390: the actual (Ind3) action on a changed packet carrier

S1345 recorded the exact first-field mismatch of the target
DPrimeStripProcession on the genuine integral log-shell tensor packet:

* the target requires ind3 : Nat -> T -> T on the packet T;
* the actual S1266 (Ind3) data are the Int-indexed times-mu stage comparison
  (m : Int) -> Ind3Stage I n m v =* Ind3Stage I n 0 v, and S1345's actual
  Nat-action lives on the total stage (m : Int) x Ind3Stage I n m v.

This file does the carrier change explicitly.  It constructs a genuine
DPrimeStripProcession on the product carrier

  integral log-shell packet x Fmod log-shell packet x total Ind3 stage.

On that carrier:

* ind1 is the actual S1264 capsule reindexing integralInd1Tensor (an
  involution, hence a ZMod 2-action), acting on the integral packet;
* ind2 is the actual S1265 Fmod-unit packet action at the actual source unit
  -1 (also an involution, hence a ZMod 2-action), acting on the Fmod packet;
* ind3 is the actual S1345 total-stage transport, acting on the stage
  component via the S1266 comparison stageEquiv; it is not the identity.

The exact first field on the unchanged integral packet is recorded in
IntegralPacketInd3FirstField: the target type is
Nat -> IntegralTensorPacket -> IntegralTensorPacket, while the actual S1266
datum is the Int-indexed multiplicative stage comparison.  No function is
inserted into the packet ind3 slot by pretending it is the stage action.

The additive label group is changed as well: PacketProcessionLabel is
ZMod 2 x ZMod 2, and it is not identified with the source Ind1/Ind2 label
groups.  The second factor is the actual subgroup generated by the source
Fmod unit -1, not the full source unit-copy group; the source label-group
mismatch recorded by S1315 remains open.

No sorry, no new axiom, no PUnit/one-point model, no IQSpan, and no
arbitrary constant is used.
-/

noncomputable section
set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option linter.checkUnivs false
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

